<title>UK: Tomkins extends gain on buy-back news.</title>
<headline>Tomkins extends gain on buy-back news.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Tomkins Plc rose to a four-month high on Tuesday, defying the market's overall weak tone amid positive press and analyst comment following Monday's results and share buy-back.</p>
<p>The stock was up seven pence at 285-1/2 by 0927 GMT in volume of 4.1 million shares, after earlier rising as high as 288p -- its highest since mid-March.</p>
</text>
